{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"ALSA-2026:102194","published":"2026-11-23T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-11-23T16:30:02.284636663Z","related":["CVE-2025-14017","CVE-2026-18924","CVE-2026-80230"],"upstream":["CVE-2025-14017","CVE-2026-18924","CVE-2026-80230"],"summary":"Moderate: curl security update","details":"The curl packages provide the libcurl library and the curl utility for downloading files from servers using various protocols, including HTTP, FTP, and LDAP.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * curl: curl: Security bypass due to global TLS option changes in multi-threaded LDAPS transfers (CVE-2025-14017)\n  * curl: libcurl: Use-after-free in HTTP/2 Server Push with shared connections (CVE-2026-18924)\n  * curl: curl: Public key pinning bypass allows unauthenticated connections (CVE-2026-80230)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"curl","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/curl"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"7.61.1-34.el8_10.21"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:102194.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libcurl","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/libcurl"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"7.61.1-34.el8_10.21"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:102194.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libcurl-devel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/libcurl-devel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"7.61.1-34.el8_10.21"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:102194.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libcurl-m